<translation id="5027700305690795897">JemaOS dastlabki sozlashni yakunlamagan.</translation>
<translation id="4257170804800372451">JemaOS va Thot <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_CHROMIUM" />Chromium<ph name="END_LINK_CHROMIUM" /> ochiq manbali loyihasi va boshqa <ph name="BEGIN_LINK_OSS" />ochiq manbali dasturiy ta'minot<ph name="END_LINK_OSS" /> tufayli yaratilgan.</translation>
